  "prefLabel": "Ed 902.01 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 902.01 “Applicant” means a community-based organization, school district, or private organization that applies for funding under Ed 906 in order to provide the program services listed in Ed 903.02 as a program participant, or to receive those services.\n\nSource. #8582, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10649, eff 7-26-14",
